---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM

# --- The Tab/Indent Fix ---
UseTab: Never
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4

# --- The K&R Brace Fix ---
# This forces braces to attach to for, if, while, functions, and classes
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach

# --- Clean JUCE Layout Tweaks ---
AccessModifierOffset: -4
ColumnLimit: 100
---